('b4067e41-72c8-5335-94ba-21da534f9010','65681713-da0c-520b-804c-723457aeb859',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to make a park, garden etc look attractive and interesting by changing its design , and by planting trees and bushes etc',null,null,'با تغییر طراحی و کاشت درخت و بوته و غیره، پارک، باغ و غیره را جذاب و جالب جلوه دهید.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The area around the mill pond has also been landscaped.","translation":"اطراف حوض آسیاب نیز محوطه سازی شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001754477.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
