('432d578c-8049-5689-8380-dc722c3f5539','b4b0a2ef-3a29-564c-8a81-48bf4076ff09',1,'moral rule','قانون اخلاقی','spoken & written','a moral rule or belief about what is right and wrong , that influences how you behave','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'اصل، اصل اخلاقی؛ قاعده (کار)؛ اصل (فیزیک)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['strict principles Rosa is a woman of strict moral principles.','strong principles (= that someone believes in very strongly ) a man of strong principles','high principles (= strong beliefs about right and wrong ) Dunn''s high principles and pleasant manner won him the real affection of his colleagues.','moral principles Criminal law should be used to protect and reinforce moral principles.','religious/political principles Doesn’t working on Sunday conflict with your religious principles?','socialist principles Would he stick to his socialist principles after being elected prime minister?','have principles I may have no money and no power but I have principles.','stick to your principles (= act according to them, even when this is difficult ) Throughout this time, he stuck to his principles and spoke out against injustice.','betray/compromise your principles (= do something that is against your principles ) I knew I could lie to help him, but it would be betraying my principles.','abandon your principles (= stop believing in them or trying to act by them ) It has been said that he abandoned his basic political principles while he was in power.','be against somebody’s principles It’s against my principles to eat meat.','as a matter of principle (= because of moral beliefs about right and wrong ) As a matter of principle one should never yield to terrorism.','a man/woman of principle (= someone with strong moral ideas ) He is the only candidate who has demonstrated that he is a man of principle.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Schools try to teach children a set of principles.","translation":"مدارس سعی می کنند مجموعه ای از اصول را به کودکان آموزش دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001698666.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s got no principles at all!","translation":"او اصلاً اصولی ندارد!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001698674.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s against my principles to accept gifts from clients.","translation":"پذیرش هدایایی از مشتریان برخلاف اصول من است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001698678.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('98f47cc3-2ad1-5bd0-a6cd-db04792c187f','b4b0a2ef-3a29-564c-8a81-48bf4076ff09',2,'idea behind something','ایده پشت چیزی','spoken & written','the basic idea that a plan or system is based on','[ countable ]',null,'ایده اصلی که یک طرح یا سیستم بر اساس آن استوار است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The general principle is that education should be available to all children up to the age of 16.","translation":"اصل کلی این است که آموزش باید برای همه کودکان تا سن 16 سالگی در دسترس باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001698686.mp3"},{"sentence":"the basic principles of business management","translation":"اصول اساسی مدیریت کسب و کار","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001771684.mp3"},{"sentence":"the principles of French law","translation":"اصول حقوق فرانسه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001698696.mp3"},{"sentence":"Reflexology is based on the principle that specific areas on the feet correspond to different parts of the body.","translation":"رفلکسولوژی بر این اصل استوار است که نواحی خاصی روی پا با قسمت های مختلف بدن مطابقت دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001771687.mp3"},{"sentence":"The project worked on the principle that each person’s experience was equally valuable.","translation":"این پروژه بر این اصل کار می کرد که تجربه هر فرد به یک اندازه ارزشمند است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001771688.mp3"},{"sentence":"the principles behind government policies","translation":"اصول پشت سیاست های دولت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001698711.mp3"},{"sentence":"He called for a return to first principles (= the most important ideas ) of road safety for children.","translation":"او خواستار بازگشت به اصول اولیه (= مهمترین ایده ها) ایمنی جاده برای کودکان شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001771692.mp3"},{"sentence":"Similar principles apply in the case of older children (= the principles are the same as others that have been mentioned ) .","translation":"در مورد فرزندان بزرگتر نیز چنین اصولی اعمال می شود (= اصول همان اصولی است که ذکر شد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001843022.mp3"}]'::jsonb,8),
