('dd808937-8b37-5ebd-8f19-507797e26833','1233c651-a97a-5358-bb1e-de92a16cee1d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a way of doing something, especially the correct or usual way',null,null,'رویه، دستورالعمل؛ پروسه (مکانیکی)؛ رویه (علمی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the correct/proper procedure What''s the correct procedure for applying for a grant?','normal/standard procedure It’s standard procedure to take photographs of the scene of the crime.','a legal procedure Adoption was not made a legal procedure until 1926.','a disciplinary procedure Unacceptable behaviour will be dealt with through our usual disciplinary procedures.','a complaints procedure The company has a standard complaints procedure.','a selection procedure An interview is an important part of our selection procedure.','a safety procedure Apparently the accidents were due to inadequate safety procedures.','follow a procedure It’s important that you always follow the correct procedure.','go through a procedure We had to go through the whole procedure again.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"What’s the procedure for applying for a visa?","translation":"مراحل درخواست ویزا چگونه است؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000295050.mp3"},{"sentence":"This is standard procedure for getting rid of toxic waste.","translation":"این روش استاندارد برای خلاص شدن از شر زباله های سمی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000295053.mp3"},{"sentence":"All schools have disciplinary procedures they must follow .","translation":"همه مدارس دارای رویه های انضباطی هستند که باید از آنها پیروی کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001561267.mp3"},{"sentence":"On board, we were given the usual talk on safety procedures (= what to do if an accident happens, or to prevent an accident ) .","translation":"در کشتی، صحبت‌های معمول در مورد رویه‌های ایمنی (= در صورت وقوع حادثه، یا جلوگیری از تصادف چه باید کرد) به ما داده شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001561271.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('aa6b961b-6d8d-5324-b349-d0e25ec6b3e8','1233c651-a97a-5358-bb1e-de92a16cee1d',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a medical treatment or operation',null,null,'یک درمان یا عمل پزشکی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the correct/proper procedure What''s the correct procedure for applying for a grant?','normal/standard procedure It’s standard procedure to take photographs of the scene of the crime.','a legal procedure Adoption was not made a legal procedure until 1926.','a disciplinary procedure Unacceptable behaviour will be dealt with through our usual disciplinary procedures.','a complaints procedure The company has a standard complaints procedure.','a selection procedure An interview is an important part of our selection procedure.','a safety procedure Apparently the accidents were due to inadequate safety procedures.','follow a procedure It’s important that you always follow the correct procedure.','go through a procedure We had to go through the whole procedure again.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Liposuction is a minor surgical procedure .","translation":"لیپوساکشن یک روش جراحی جزئی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000295058.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
