('3f2dc95e-8f24-5071-b23c-8d9590b5aba9','6fa35c2f-6b59-5001-aa78-7e85896a785d',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a condition in an agreement or law','[ countable ]',null,'شرط در یک قرارداد یا قانون','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The agreement includes a provision for each side to check the other side’s weapons.","translation":"این توافق شامل مضامینی است که هر طرف باید سلاح های طرف مقابل را بررسی کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000306029.mp3"},{"sentence":"Under the provisions of the Act, employers must supply safety equipment.","translation":"طبق مقررات این قانون، کارفرمایان باید تجهیزات ایمنی را تهیه کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001592159.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('ca0487ab-170d-5d34-98ec-b01be2a83f3a','e855e4da-f9ad-5740-9076-516b767760c9',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to provide someone or something with a lot of food and supplies , especially for a journey',null,null,'تهیه غذا و آذوقه زیادی برای کسی یا چیزی مخصوصاً برای سفر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('405ec5e0-7fb1-5d8e-875e-25a26d98f6c3','4f7c509a-b4ad-506c-90c8-3992e6c69d76',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the attention that someone or something gets from newspapers , television etc',null,null,'تبلیغات، شهرت (رسانه)؛ اطلاع‌رسانی (پخش)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['bad publicity ( also adverse/negative publicity formal ) Fatty foods have received much bad publicity in recent years. They don''t want any more adverse publicity.','good publicity Top exam results are good publicity for schools.','free publicity Giving away samples is one way of getting free publicity for your products.','widespread/wide publicity The scandal had received widespread publicity.','national publicity Candidates aim to get national publicity during election campaigns.','considerable/massive/extensive publicity The opening of the trial generated considerable publicity.','maximum publicity Throughout the strike, the workers achieved maximum publicity for their demands.','unwelcome publicity Their relationship had attracted unwelcome publicity.','get publicity ( also receive publicity ) Climate change is getting a lot of publicity. Such studies have received a lot of publicity.','attract publicity Two recommendations in the report have attracted publicity.','gain publicity Appearing on a chat show means you gain publicity.','generate publicity The publication of the book generated an enormous amount of publicity.','give publicity to something Much publicity was given to their allegations in the British press.','avoid publicity They wanted to settle the matter quietly in order to avoid bad publicity.','shun publicity He lives quietly in Acton with his wife and two sons and shuns publicity.','seek publicity He sought neither reward nor publicity for his work.','the glare of publicity (= a lot of publicity, which can make you feel uncomfortable ) He carried on his life in the full glare of publicity.','a blaze of publicity (= a lot of publicity ) His marriage broke up in a blaze of publicity.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Standards in education have received much publicity over the last few years.","translation":"استانداردها در آموزش در چند سال اخیر تبلیغات زیادی دریافت کرده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001561809.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s important to gain good publicity for the school.","translation":"کسب تبلیغات خوب برای مدرسه مهم است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001561816.mp3"},{"sentence":"The adverse publicity had damaged sales.","translation":"تبلیغات نامطلوب به فروش آسیب رسانده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001561815.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('5ecaca82-7b3d-5532-a269-54d5bb8d42f3','4f7c509a-b4ad-506c-90c8-3992e6c69d76',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the business of making sure that people know about a new product , film etc or what a particular famous person is doing',null,null,'کسب و کار اطمینان از اینکه مردم در مورد یک محصول جدید، فیلم و غیره یا کاری که یک فرد مشهور خاص انجام می دهد، می دانند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['bad publicity ( also adverse/negative publicity formal ) Fatty foods have received much bad publicity in recent years. They don''t want any more adverse publicity.','good publicity Top exam results are good publicity for schools.','free publicity Giving away samples is one way of getting free publicity for your products.','widespread/wide publicity The scandal had received widespread publicity.','national publicity Candidates aim to get national publicity during election campaigns.','considerable/massive/extensive publicity The opening of the trial generated considerable publicity.','maximum publicity Throughout the strike, the workers achieved maximum publicity for their demands.','unwelcome publicity Their relationship had attracted unwelcome publicity.','get publicity ( also receive publicity ) Climate change is getting a lot of publicity. Such studies have received a lot of publicity.','attract publicity Two recommendations in the report have attracted publicity.','gain publicity Appearing on a chat show means you gain publicity.','generate publicity The publication of the book generated an enormous amount of publicity.','give publicity to something Much publicity was given to their allegations in the British press.','avoid publicity They wanted to settle the matter quietly in order to avoid bad publicity.','shun publicity He lives quietly in Acton with his wife and two sons and shuns publicity.','seek publicity He sought neither reward nor publicity for his work.','the glare of publicity (= a lot of publicity, which can make you feel uncomfortable ) He carried on his life in the full glare of publicity.','a blaze of publicity (= a lot of publicity ) His marriage broke up in a blaze of publicity.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Who’s going to do the show’s publicity?","translation":"چه کسی قرار است تبلیغات نمایش را انجام دهد؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000270458.mp3"},{"sentence":"The Government has launched a publicity campaign .","translation":"دولت کمپین تبلیغاتی راه اندازی کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001561817.mp3"},{"sentence":"Is their much-reported romance just a publicity stunt (= something that is only done to get publicity ) ?","translation":"آیا داستان عاشقانه آنها فقط یک شیرین کاری تبلیغاتی است (= کاری که فقط برای تبلیغات انجام می شود)؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001561822.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('5c7ebc97-6ed7-5a45-8c17-9a299bf7cfef','e4348a20-2494-564f-8835-e8d28859c31a',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a person or company whose business is to arrange the writing, production , and sale of books, newspapers etc',null,null,'ناشر، انتشارات (شرکت)؛ ناشر (مقاله)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('80fa8a6f-8ffe-5ef0-9237-6f743a3298fb','2f67bee9-c530-5bfb-ad94-9e581f118f15',1,null,null,'spoken & written','judging and dealing with situations in a practical way according to what is actually possible rather than what you would like to happen',null,null,'واقع‌بین، منطقی (برخورد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’s just not realistic to expect a promotion so soon.","translation":"انتظار ارتقاء به این زودی واقعی نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000483658.mp3"},{"sentence":"You need to be realistic about the amount you can do in a day.","translation":"شما باید در مورد مقداری که می توانید در یک روز انجام دهید واقع بین باشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001604493.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('71db2aee-8a5b-53fd-bb76-d89569f87f53','2f67bee9-c530-5bfb-ad94-9e581f118f15',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a realistic aim or hope is something that it is possible to achieve',null,null,'هدف یا امید واقع بینانه چیزی است که امکان دستیابی به آن وجود دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a realistic chance/prospect We felt we had a realistic chance of beating England.','a realistic option/alternative We do not believe there is any realistic alternative.','a realistic goal/target Set realistic goals for yourself.','a realistic expectation There are no realistic expectations of improvement.','a realistic figure/price A more realistic figure for energy saving would be 20 percent.','a realistic solution Compromise is the only realistic solution.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Is this a realistic target?","translation":"آیا این یک هدف واقع بینانه است؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001604496.mp3"},{"sentence":"I don’t think they have a realistic chance of winning.","translation":"فکر نمی کنم آنها شانس واقعی برای برنده شدن داشته باشند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001876350.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('257d52d9-986a-5eab-83c2-8b38d4c5213b','2f67bee9-c530-5bfb-ad94-9e581f118f15',3,null,null,'spoken & written','realistic pictures or stories show things as they are in real life',null,null,'تصاویر یا داستان های واقع گرایانه همه چیز را همانطور که در زندگی واقعی هستند نشان می دهند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a realistic portrayal of life in Victorian Britain","translation":"تصویری واقع گرایانه از زندگی در بریتانیای دوره ویکتوریا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000483672.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('3f4f8dcf-a7e7-5b24-a90f-bbc9a4b6e1f1','e7ac82e1-cd59-54fb-89f0-913142a388cf',1,'welcome/reaction','استقبال/واکنش','spoken & written','a particular type of welcome for someone, or a particular type of reaction to their ideas, work etc','[ countable usually singular ]',null,'پذیرایی، استقبال؛ پذیرش (واکنش)؛ پیشخوان (هتل)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a warm reception (= friendly or approving ) The prince was given a warm reception when he visited Birmingham.','an enthusiastic/rapturous/rousing reception (= in which people show a lot of approval in a noisy way ) She received an enthusiastic reception.','a hostile reception When reporters arrived at the house, they got a hostile reception.','a cool/chilly/frosty reception (= not friendly or approving ) His idea got a cool reception from his colleagues.','a lukewarm reception (= not enthusiastic ) I am bewildered by the lukewarm reception given to her latest album.','a mixed reception (= when some people like something and some do not ) His first novel received a mixed reception.','a favourable/positive reception The movie got a favourable reception from audiences and critics alike.','get/have a warm etc reception ( also receive a warm etc reception formal ) As he came on, Rocky got a great reception from the crowd.','meet with a warm etc reception formal They met with a chilly reception from my mother.','give somebody/something a warm etc reception Opposition parties gave the proposals a lukewarm reception.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She was unsure of her reception after everything that had happened.","translation":"بعد از هر اتفاقی که افتاده بود از استقبالش مطمئن نبود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001604965.mp3"},{"sentence":"The delegates gave him a warm reception .","translation":"نمايندگان از او استقبال گرمي كردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001604968.mp3"},{"sentence":"His ideas met with a hostile reception.","translation":"ایده های او با استقبال خصمانه ای روبرو شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001604971.mp3"},{"sentence":"He got a great reception from the crowd.","translation":"او با استقبال چشمگیر جمعیت روبرو شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001770568.mp3"},{"sentence":"The plans received a mixed reception from unions (= some people liked them, others did not ) .","translation":"این طرح ها با استقبال متفاوت اتحادیه ها مواجه شد (= برخی از مردم آنها را دوست داشتند، برخی دیگر نه).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001604972.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('5fc7de3f-ffdd-5ec3-9d60-4f19195ab95b','e7ac82e1-cd59-54fb-89f0-913142a388cf',2,'hotel/office','هتل / دفتر','spoken & written','the desk or office where visitors arriving in a hotel or large organization go first','[ uncountable ]',null,'میز یا دفتری که بازدیدکنندگانی که به یک هتل یا سازمان بزرگ می‌رسند ابتدا به آنجا می‌روند',array['lobby']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Please leave your key at the reception desk .","translation":"لطفا کلید خود را در میز پذیرش بگذارید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000760332.mp3"},{"sentence":"I asked the man at reception.","translation":"از مرد در پذیرایی پرسیدم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001300.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ll wait for you in reception.","translation":"در پذیرایی منتظر شما هستم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000760343.mp3"},{"sentence":"the reception area","translation":"قسمت پذیرش","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001301.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('53584c0b-f2d5-5b1a-a5e7-7aec6b37db95','e7ac82e1-cd59-54fb-89f0-913142a388cf',3,'party','مهمانی','spoken & written','a large formal party to celebrate an event or to welcome someone','[ countable ]',null,'یک مهمانی رسمی بزرگ برای جشن گرفتن یک رویداد یا به استقبال کسی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’s an ideal location for a wedding reception .","translation":"این یک مکان ایده آل برای یک جشن عروسی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000760324.mp3"},{"sentence":"The occasion was marked by a civic reception .","translation":"این مناسبت با استقبال مردمی همراه بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001604999.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('0de51f45-f5ec-5512-9d0d-173eafea6789','e7ac82e1-cd59-54fb-89f0-913142a388cf',4,'signals','سیگنال ها','spoken & written','the act of receiving radio , television , or other signals , or the quality of signals you receive','[ uncountable ]',null,'عمل دریافت سیگنال های رادیویی، تلویزیونی یا سایر سیگنال ها، یا کیفیت سیگنال هایی که دریافت می کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Mobile phone users have complained of poor reception in the area.","translation":"کاربران تلفن همراه از استقبال ضعیف در این منطقه شکایت کرده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00714.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('8f4d9fd2-7839-529f-92d9-35f615d5008a','e7ac82e1-cd59-54fb-89f0-913142a388cf',5,'football','فوتبال','spoken & written','the act of catching the ball in American football','[ countable ]',null,'عمل گرفتن توپ در فوتبال آمریکایی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('8ba14f18-b705-5b92-a3fc-b1ed95fe8557','5ba51d22-4a36-56d1-b250-bb39bd04a9e1',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to know who someone is or what something is, because you have seen, heard, experienced , or learned about them in the past',null,null,'شناختن، بازشناسی (فرد)؛ رسمیت شناختن (دولت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I didn’t recognize you in your uniform.","translation":"من تو را با لباست نشناختم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000760999.mp3"},{"sentence":"It was malaria, but Dr Lee hadn’t recognized the symptoms.","translation":"مالاریا بود، اما دکتر لی علائم را تشخیص نداده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000761002.mp3"},{"sentence":"I knew it was her by the hat she was wearing.","translation":"با کلاهی که به سر داشت می دانستم اوست.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,3),
('dd9eb914-616a-5640-b385-05e6baf874ce','5ba51d22-4a36-56d1-b250-bb39bd04a9e1',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to officially accept that an organization , government, document etc has legal or official authority',null,null,'به طور رسمی بپذیرید که یک سازمان، دولت، سند و غیره دارای اختیارات قانونی یا رسمی است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"British medical qualifications are recognized in Canada.","translation":"مدارک پزشکی بریتانیایی در کانادا به رسمیت شناخته می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000761009.mp3"},{"sentence":"The World Health Organization has recognized alcoholism as a disease since 1951.","translation":"سازمان جهانی بهداشت از سال 1951 اعتیاد به الکل را به عنوان یک بیماری به رسمیت شناخته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001771343.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('1aed28bb-70cf-5424-a1bc-50d7581fb766','5ba51d22-4a36-56d1-b250-bb39bd04a9e1',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to accept or admit that something is true',null,null,'قبول یا اعتراف به اینکه چیزی درست است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"One must recognise that homesickness is natural.","translation":"باید تشخیص داد که دلتنگی طبیعی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001771344.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is important to recognize how little we know about this disease.","translation":"مهم است که بدانیم چقدر در مورد این بیماری می دانیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000761030.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('25758b68-1b1f-50e6-ac62-c8eadf8a620a','5ba51d22-4a36-56d1-b250-bb39bd04a9e1',4,null,null,'spoken & written','if something is recognized by people, they realize that it is important or very good',null,null,'اگر چیزی توسط مردم تشخیص داده شود، متوجه می شوند که مهم یا بسیار خوب است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Alexander tried to get his work recognized by the medical profession.","translation":"اسکندر تلاش کرد تا کار خود را توسط حرفه پزشکی به رسمیت بشناسد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001614025.mp3"},{"sentence":"Lawrence’s novel was eventually recognized as a work of genius.","translation":"رمان لارنس در نهایت به عنوان یک اثر نابغه شناخته شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000761017.mp3"},{"sentence":"a recognized authority on Roman pottery","translation":"یک مرجع شناخته شده در سفال رومی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001771350.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('b51e1554-3c32-5452-9a44-bfdb061481c3','5ba51d22-4a36-56d1-b250-bb39bd04a9e1',5,null,null,'spoken & written','to officially and publicly thank someone for something they have done, by giving them a special honour',null,null,'تشکر رسمی و علنی از کسی برای کاری که انجام داده است، با دادن افتخاری خاص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He was recognized for having saved many lives.","translation":"او به خاطر نجات جان بسیاری از افراد شناخته شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001614026.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('f43248df-ed13-54f3-bf90-9ff72e437e26','f0af52de-f368-5df4-a2e1-4254d28258e1',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to advise someone to do something, especially because you have special knowledge of a situation or subject',null,null,'توصیه کردن، پیشنهاد کردن (با دانش)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I recommend that you get some professional advice.","translation":"توصیه می‌کنم از مشاوره حرفه‌ای استفاده کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000761138.mp3"},{"sentence":"Doctors strongly recommend that fathers should be present at their baby’s birth.","translation":"پزشکان اکیداً توصیه می کنند که پدران باید هنگام تولد نوزادشان حضور داشته باشند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001771360.mp3"},{"sentence":"I would never recommend using a sunbed on a regular basis.","translation":"من هرگز استفاده از تخت آفتابگیر را به طور منظم توصیه نمی کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001614053.mp3"},{"sentence":"Sleeping tablets are not recommended in this case.","translation":"قرص خواب در این مورد توصیه نمی شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000761135.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is dangerous to exceed the recommended dose .","translation":"بیش از دوز توصیه شده خطرناک است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001614045.mp3"},{"sentence":"Students are recommended to make an appointment with a counselor.","translation":"به دانش آموزان توصیه می شود که با یک مشاور وقت ملاقات بگذارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00717.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('f8833909-255a-588f-b1bd-427da58214af','f0af52de-f368-5df4-a2e1-4254d28258e1',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to say that something or someone is good, or suggest them for a particular purpose or job',null,null,'گفتن اینکه چیزی یا کسی خوب است یا به آنها برای هدف یا شغل خاصی پیشنهاد می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['highly recommend This book is highly recommended by those who have used it.','heartily recommend (= strongly and enthusiastically ) I heartily recommend the cheese sandwiches.','thoroughly recommend Overall I can thoroughly recommend this film to anyone with an interest in space travel.','definitely/certainly recommend We would definitely recommend these books to students in fourth to sixth grade.','personally recommend Are there any hair colouring products you can personally recommend?']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I recommend the butter chicken – it’s delicious.","translation":"من مرغ کره ای را توصیه می کنم - خوشمزه است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000761151.mp3"},{"sentence":"Can you recommend a good lawyer?","translation":"میشه یه وکیل خوب معرفی کنید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000761152.mp3"},{"sentence":"I recommend this book to anyone with an interest in chemistry.","translation":"این کتاب را به کسانی که به شیمی علاقه دارند توصیه می کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000761155.mp3"},{"sentence":"Which type of oil do you recommend for my car?","translation":"چه نوع روغنی را برای ماشین من پیشنهاد می کنید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000761158.mp3"},{"sentence":"I have decided to recommend you for the directorship.","translation":"من تصمیم گرفتم شما را برای مدیریت پیشنهاد کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000761161.mp3"},{"sentence":"The hotel is highly recommended.","translation":"هتل به شدت توصیه می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000761164.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('2bf449d9-f1b6-5a41-8206-3a20f4093721','f0af52de-f368-5df4-a2e1-4254d28258e1',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'something has much/little/nothing to recommend it','توصیه کردن، پیشنهاد کردن (با دانش)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('b1d41cc3-1b24-5600-bce7-db37c399d735','25b4e38a-e44e-54e8-be86-be9066ba746c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','music , sound, or images that have been stored on a disc , computer file , or tape','[ countable ]',null,'ضبط، رکورد (موزیک)؛ ضبط (صدا)؛ ضبط (ویدئو)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Have you heard the new recording of Mozart’s Requiem?","translation":"آیا ضبط جدید رکوئیم موتزارت را شنیده اید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000761614.mp3"},{"sentence":"a video recording of the interview","translation":"یک فیلم ضبط شده از مصاحبه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001771412.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('be71853d-7fd7-5260-9bf2-ecdf798d0452','25b4e38a-e44e-54e8-be86-be9066ba746c',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the act of storing sound or images on tape or disc s','[ uncountable ]',null,'عمل ذخیره صدا یا تصاویر روی نوار یا دیسک','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('7c3b075e-7e9d-51c4-85cc-f9fa82bb0ae4','4d499786-a6e0-58ac-86d9-e41404c49056',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a decrease in the size , price , or amount of something, or the act of decreasing something','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'کاهش، کاهش‌دهنده؛ کاهش (قیمت)؛ کاهش (سرباز)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a big/large reduction You may have to take a big reduction in salary.','a substantial/considerable reduction (= large enough to have an effect or be important ) Farmers have suffered a substantial reduction in income.','a significant reduction (= large and noticeable ) There has been a significant reduction in traffic since the bypass was built.','a massive reduction (= very large ) There is no reason why the new technology should mean a massive reduction in employment.','a dramatic/drastic reduction (= surprisingly large ) The most immediate effect of retirement is a dramatic reduction in living standards.','a sharp reduction (= large and quick ) High interest rates brought about a sharp reduction in sales.','a gradual reduction The markets are hoping for a gradual reduction in interest rates.','a marked reduction (= very easy to notice ) There has been a marked reduction in arrests since the ban on alcohol at stadiums.','a 10%/40% etc reduction The 30 mph speed limit led to a 50 percent reduction in pedestrian deaths.','a price reduction Retailers may introduce price reductions to attract custom away from their competitors.','arms reduction They held talks about further arms reductions.','make a reduction Significant reductions are being made in the defense budget.','a reduction plan/programme/scheme The terms of the treaty call for a three-phase troop reduction programme.','reduction targets The agreement set strict reduction targets for carbon emissions.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"strategies for noise reduction","translation":"استراتژی های کاهش نویز","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000766375.mp3"},{"sentence":"a slight reduction in the price of oil","translation":"کاهش جزئی قیمت نفت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000766374.mp3"},{"sentence":"the reduction of interest rates","translation":"کاهش نرخ بهره","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001876524.mp3"},{"sentence":"substantial reductions on children’s clothes","translation":"کاهش قابل توجه لباس های کودکان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001876527.mp3"},{"sentence":"The company promised they would make no staff reductions for at least two years.","translation":"این شرکت قول داده است که حداقل به مدت دو سال هیچ کاهشی در کارکنان نخواهد داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001540280.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('0f20b08e-8620-5e6e-83b4-5719b346ad01','a398a101-dec6-5127-ade1-9850680eadf9',1,null,null,'spoken & written','part of something you say or write in which you mention a person or thing','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'ارجاع، اشاره؛ معرف (نامه)؛ مرجع (کتاب)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make reference to something Official reports made no reference to the incident.','there is a reference to something There are 32 references to eagles in the Bible.','a specific/direct/explicit reference (= mentioning something specifically/directly etc ) No specific reference was made to the race of the children.','an oblique reference (= not direct ) He added, in an oblique reference to the US, that ‘some countries could do more’.','a brief reference Brief references to the tragedy have appeared in the French press.','a passing reference (= one that you make while you are talking about something else ) He made only a passing reference to his injury.','frequent/constant/repeated references Medieval literature contains frequent references to insanity.','an occasional reference During the interview, he made only occasional references to his forthcoming autobiography.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There is no direct reference to her own childhood in the novel.","translation":"هیچ اشاره مستقیمی به دوران کودکی خودش در رمان وجود ندارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000768282.mp3"},{"sentence":"The article made no reference to previous research on the subject.","translation":"مقاله هیچ اشاره ای به تحقیقات قبلی در مورد این موضوع نداشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001540415.mp3"},{"sentence":"The governor made only a passing reference to the problem of unemployment (= he mentioned it quickly ) .","translation":"فرماندار فقط اشاره ای گذرا به مشکل بیکاری کرد (= سریع اشاره کرد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001540424.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('1bbe8a8f-06bb-53c8-8b8b-61628a83f991','a398a101-dec6-5127-ade1-9850680eadf9',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the act of looking at something for information','[ uncountable ]',null,'عمل نگاه کردن به چیزی برای کسب اطلاعات','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make reference to something Official reports made no reference to the incident.','there is a reference to something There are 32 references to eagles in the Bible.','a specific/direct/explicit reference (= mentioning something specifically/directly etc ) No specific reference was made to the race of the children.','an oblique reference (= not direct ) He added, in an oblique reference to the US, that ‘some countries could do more’.','a brief reference Brief references to the tragedy have appeared in the French press.','a passing reference (= one that you make while you are talking about something else ) He made only a passing reference to his injury.','frequent/constant/repeated references Medieval literature contains frequent references to insanity.','an occasional reference During the interview, he made only occasional references to his forthcoming autobiography.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"A vocabulary index is included for easy reference.","translation":"نمایه واژگان برای مرجع آسان گنجانده شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000768294.mp3"},{"sentence":"Keep their price list on file for future reference (= so that it can be looked at in the future ) .","translation":"لیست قیمت آنها را برای مراجعات بعدی در پرونده نگه دارید (= تا بتوان در آینده به آن نگاه کرد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001540427.mp3"},{"sentence":"The book will become a standard work of reference (= a book that people look at for information ) .","translation":"کتاب به یک اثر مرجع استاندارد تبدیل خواهد شد (= کتابی که مردم برای کسب اطلاعات به آن نگاه می کنند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001772544.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
