('4c35347a-1507-51a9-8b94-931351cf89d8','a398a101-dec6-5127-ade1-9850680eadf9',5,null,null,'spoken & written','a letter containing information about you that is written by someone who knows you well, and is usually intended for a new employer','[ countable ]',null,'نامه ای حاوی اطلاعاتی درباره شما که توسط شخصی که شما را به خوبی می شناسد نوشته شده است و معمولاً برای یک کارفرمای جدید در نظر گرفته شده است.',array['referee']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make reference to something Official reports made no reference to the incident.','there is a reference to something There are 32 references to eagles in the Bible.','a specific/direct/explicit reference (= mentioning something specifically/directly etc ) No specific reference was made to the race of the children.','an oblique reference (= not direct ) He added, in an oblique reference to the US, that ‘some countries could do more’.','a brief reference Brief references to the tragedy have appeared in the French press.','a passing reference (= one that you make while you are talking about something else ) He made only a passing reference to his injury.','frequent/constant/repeated references Medieval literature contains frequent references to insanity.','an occasional reference During the interview, he made only occasional references to his forthcoming autobiography.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We will need references from your former employers.","translation":"ما به مراجعی از کارفرمایان سابق شما نیاز داریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001540447.mp3"},{"sentence":"Ask your teacher to act as one of your references.","translation":"از معلم خود بخواهید که به عنوان یکی از مراجع شما عمل کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000768318.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
