('451fa57b-4de7-578b-8a97-812831639916','7d942025-1570-53f5-82d6-d10e508d62eb',1,null,null,'spoken & written','your name written in the way you usually write it, for example at the end of a letter , or on a cheque etc, to show that you have written it','[ countable ]',null,'امضا، امضا (اسناد)؛ امضا (فرد)؛ امضا (رسمی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Her signature is totally illegible (= cannot be read ) .","translation":"امضای او کاملاً ناخوانا است (= قابل خواندن نیست).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000685410.mp3"},{"sentence":"The school collected 4,000 signatures for the petition.","translation":"مدرسه 4000 امضا برای این طومار جمع آوری کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000685411.mp3"},{"sentence":"The Ukrainians put their signatures to the Lisbon Protocol.","translation":"اوکراینی ها پروتکل لیسبون را امضا کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020236.mp3"},{"sentence":"Someone’s forged my signature (= made an illegal copy of my name to deceive people ) on this letter.","translation":"کسی امضای من را جعل کرده است (= از نام من کپی غیرقانونی برای فریب مردم ساخته است) در این نامه.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001672717.mp3"},{"sentence":"Each child must obtain the signature of his or her parents.","translation":"هر کودک باید امضای والدین خود را دریافت کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001672724.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('3011bf71-330b-5f18-b283-eb0699ed6e67','7d942025-1570-53f5-82d6-d10e508d62eb',2,null,null,'formal','the act of signing something','[ uncountable ]',null,'عمل امضا کردن چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We will send you a copy of the agreement for signature.","translation":"ما یک نسخه از توافق نامه را برای امضا برای شما ارسال می کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001775191.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
