('28d78ab9-b177-512d-947d-7583fb72dd63','09e6ded6-be17-5686-8267-8b6bf5e37b29',3,null,null,'spoken & written','relating to fighting wars',null,null,'مربوط به جنگ های جنگی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Marseilles was of great strategic importance .","translation":"مارسی از اهمیت استراتژیک بالایی برخوردار بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001600076.mp3"},{"sentence":"strategic nuclear missiles","translation":"موشک های هسته ای استراتژیک","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001600080.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('245eb13d-949c-5a5d-8a39-7c2bb7c40fbc','315c17dd-8914-5824-9ef0-3f5a37da892f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the way in which the parts of something are connected with each other and form a whole , or the thing that these parts make up','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'ساختار، تشکیلات؛ ساختار (داده)؛ ساخت (بدن)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['social/political/economic structure Many changes had taken place in the social and political structure of the island.','class structure (= the way society is organized according to people’s education, jobs, income etc ) Britain had a very rigid class structure.','power structure (= the way in which the group of people who control a country or organization are organized ) He was a critic of the country’s power structure.','management structure (= the way managers of a business are organized ) Reform of the management structure was needed.','career structure (= the way a profession is organized which allows you to move up and get better jobs ) Teachers now have a proper career structure.','basic structure These genes are involved in determining the basic structure of cells.','internal structure Scientists have been investigating the internal structure of the planet Mars.','molecular structure The book tells of the race to find the molecular structure of DNA.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the social structure of organizations","translation":"ساختار اجتماعی سازمان ها","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001582199.mp3"},{"sentence":"challenges to the existing power structure","translation":"چالش‌های ساختار قدرت موجود","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001582200.mp3"},{"sentence":"A new management structure has been introduced.","translation":"ساختار مدیریتی جدیدی معرفی شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001582203.mp3"},{"sentence":"the structure of the brain","translation":"ساختار مغز","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000623190.mp3"},{"sentence":"molecular structures","translation":"ساختارهای مولکولی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001582207.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('de3220a9-081a-58a8-8740-7ea95554150c','315c17dd-8914-5824-9ef0-3f5a37da892f',2,null,null,'spoken & written','something that has been built, especially something large such as a building or a bridge','[ countable ]',null,'چیزی که ساخته شده است، به ویژه چیزهای بزرگ مانند ساختمان یا پل','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['social/political/economic structure Many changes had taken place in the social and political structure of the island.','class structure (= the way society is organized according to people’s education, jobs, income etc ) Britain had a very rigid class structure.','power structure (= the way in which the group of people who control a country or organization are organized ) He was a critic of the country’s power structure.','management structure (= the way managers of a business are organized ) Reform of the management structure was needed.','career structure (= the way a profession is organized which allows you to move up and get better jobs ) Teachers now have a proper career structure.','basic structure These genes are involved in determining the basic structure of cells.','internal structure Scientists have been investigating the internal structure of the planet Mars.','molecular structure The book tells of the race to find the molecular structure of DNA.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a high wooden structure with a curved roof","translation":"یک سازه چوبی بلند با سقف منحنی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000623197.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ca85f300-1fea-56f6-b011-41b6f6a10ae7','315c17dd-8914-5824-9ef0-3f5a37da892f',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a situation where activities are carefully organized and planned','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'وضعیتی که در آن فعالیت ها به دقت سازماندهی و برنامه ریزی می شوند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['social/political/economic structure Many changes had taken place in the social and political structure of the island.','class structure (= the way society is organized according to people’s education, jobs, income etc ) Britain had a very rigid class structure.','power structure (= the way in which the group of people who control a country or organization are organized ) He was a critic of the country’s power structure.','management structure (= the way managers of a business are organized ) Reform of the management structure was needed.','career structure (= the way a profession is organized which allows you to move up and get better jobs ) Teachers now have a proper career structure.','basic structure These genes are involved in determining the basic structure of cells.','internal structure Scientists have been investigating the internal structure of the planet Mars.','molecular structure The book tells of the race to find the molecular structure of DNA.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"These kids require a lot of structure and stability.","translation":"این بچه ها به ساختار و ثبات زیادی نیاز دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000623209.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('eafadd85-89aa-5084-ad67-ce5629a6e144','e2876813-bdef-5fba-87b9-bf96d37386e2',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to arrange the different parts of something into a pattern or system in which each part is connected to the others',null,null,'برای مرتب کردن بخش‌های مختلف چیزی در یک الگو یا سیستم که در آن هر بخش به قسمت‌های دیگر متصل است',array['organize']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The exhibition is structured around three topics.","translation":"این نمایشگاه در سه موضوع تشکیل شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000623227.mp3"},{"sentence":"software that helps users structure their work and their data","translation":"نرم افزاری که به کاربران کمک می کند کار و داده های خود را ساختار دهند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001582209.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('11460cb3-1a99-5ee9-8f7e-a2d90005e4ab','d59fc29c-a32e-548b-abce-a5a974c29ef2',1,'material','مواد','spoken & written','a particular type of solid , liquid , or gas','[ countable ]',null,'ماده، جنس (ماده)؛ ماده (مهم)؛ ماده (شیمی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a dangerous/hazardous/harmful substance Using chemicals or other hazardous substances at work can put people''s health at risk.','a poisonous substance ( also a noxious substance formal ) (= harmful to people ) Cigarette smoke contains several poisonous substances.','a toxic substance (= harmful to people and the environment ) All toxic substances should be labelled and carefully stored in a safe place.','a radioactive substance (= containing a form of energy that can harm people ) People who work with radioactive substances are subject to strict regulations.','an illegal/banned/prohibited substance (= used mainly to refer to illegal drugs ) Any player found guilty of using banned substances faces the prospect of a lengthy suspension.','a controlled substance law (= an illegal drug ) He was charged with possessing a controlled substance.','an organic substance (= from a living thing ) Despite being an organic substance, ivory is remarkably durable.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The leaves were covered with a strange sticky substance.","translation":"برگها با ماده چسبناک عجیبی پوشیده شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001742999.mp3"},{"sentence":"harmful substances in the atmosphere","translation":"مواد مضر موجود در جو","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743002.mp3"},{"sentence":"Plutonium 238 is one of the most toxic substances known to man.","translation":"پلوتونیوم 238 یکی از سمی ترین مواد شناخته شده برای بشر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743003.mp3"},{"sentence":"Police found an illegal substance in his car.","translation":"پلیس یک ماده غیرقانونی در خودروی وی کشف کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743007.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('fcb40e8d-9209-5c0a-a04d-216f60463ce0','d59fc29c-a32e-548b-abce-a5a974c29ef2',2,'truth','حقیقت','formal','if something has substance, it is true','[ uncountable usually in questions and negatives ]',null,'اگر چیزی ماهیت داشته باشد، درست است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a dangerous/hazardous/harmful substance Using chemicals or other hazardous substances at work can put people''s health at risk.','a poisonous substance ( also a noxious substance formal ) (= harmful to people ) Cigarette smoke contains several poisonous substances.','a toxic substance (= harmful to people and the environment ) All toxic substances should be labelled and carefully stored in a safe place.','a radioactive substance (= containing a form of energy that can harm people ) People who work with radioactive substances are subject to strict regulations.','an illegal/banned/prohibited substance (= used mainly to refer to illegal drugs ) Any player found guilty of using banned substances faces the prospect of a lengthy suspension.','a controlled substance law (= an illegal drug ) He was charged with possessing a controlled substance.','an organic substance (= from a living thing ) Despite being an organic substance, ivory is remarkably durable.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There is no substance to the rumours (= they are untrue ) .","translation":"شایعات (= نادرست بودن آنها) هیچ ماده ای ندارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000626773.mp3"},{"sentence":"O''Connell’s remarks are completely without substance.","translation":"اظهارات اوکانل کاملاً بی اساس است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743012.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('5c72c816-6e9a-5594-a606-589470e47f25','d59fc29c-a32e-548b-abce-a5a974c29ef2',3,'ideas','ایده ها','spoken & written','the most important ideas contained in an argument or piece of writing','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'مهم ترین ایده های موجود در یک استدلال یا نوشته',array['essence']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a dangerous/hazardous/harmful substance Using chemicals or other hazardous substances at work can put people''s health at risk.','a poisonous substance ( also a noxious substance formal ) (= harmful to people ) Cigarette smoke contains several poisonous substances.','a toxic substance (= harmful to people and the environment ) All toxic substances should be labelled and carefully stored in a safe place.','a radioactive substance (= containing a form of energy that can harm people ) People who work with radioactive substances are subject to strict regulations.','an illegal/banned/prohibited substance (= used mainly to refer to illegal drugs ) Any player found guilty of using banned substances faces the prospect of a lengthy suspension.','a controlled substance law (= an illegal drug ) He was charged with possessing a controlled substance.','an organic substance (= from a living thing ) Despite being an organic substance, ivory is remarkably durable.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The substance of his argument was that people on welfare should work.","translation":"اصل بحث ایشان این بود که افراد بهزیستی باید کار کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743018.mp3"},{"sentence":"What she said, in substance, was that the mayor should resign.","translation":"آنچه او در اصل گفت این بود که شهردار باید استعفا دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743021.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('07ee7650-ca98-555d-adb4-7673a6ec025f','d59fc29c-a32e-548b-abce-a5a974c29ef2',4,'importance','اهمیت','formal','importance','[ uncountable ]',null,'اهمیت',array['significance']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a dangerous/hazardous/harmful substance Using chemicals or other hazardous substances at work can put people''s health at risk.','a poisonous substance ( also a noxious substance formal ) (= harmful to people ) Cigarette smoke contains several poisonous substances.','a toxic substance (= harmful to people and the environment ) All toxic substances should be labelled and carefully stored in a safe place.','a radioactive substance (= containing a form of energy that can harm people ) People who work with radioactive substances are subject to strict regulations.','an illegal/banned/prohibited substance (= used mainly to refer to illegal drugs ) Any player found guilty of using banned substances faces the prospect of a lengthy suspension.','a controlled substance law (= an illegal drug ) He was charged with possessing a controlled substance.','an organic substance (= from a living thing ) Despite being an organic substance, ivory is remarkably durable.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"It was an entertaining speech, but it lacked substance (= there was no important information in it ) .","translation":"این سخنرانی سرگرم کننده بود، اما فاقد محتوا بود (= اطلاعات مهمی در آن وجود نداشت).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743025.mp3"},{"sentence":"We should be discussing matters of substance.","translation":"ما باید در مورد مسائل ماهوی بحث کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000626764.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('83d5cd86-5f0e-5ce5-aa7e-986e154a1b0f','d59fc29c-a32e-548b-abce-a5a974c29ef2',5,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'man/woman of substance','ماده، جنس (ماده)؛ ماده (مهم)؛ ماده (شیمی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a dangerous/hazardous/harmful substance Using chemicals or other hazardous substances at work can put people''s health at risk.','a poisonous substance ( also a noxious substance formal ) (= harmful to people ) Cigarette smoke contains several poisonous substances.','a toxic substance (= harmful to people and the environment ) All toxic substances should be labelled and carefully stored in a safe place.','a radioactive substance (= containing a form of energy that can harm people ) People who work with radioactive substances are subject to strict regulations.','an illegal/banned/prohibited substance (= used mainly to refer to illegal drugs ) Any player found guilty of using banned substances faces the prospect of a lengthy suspension.','a controlled substance law (= an illegal drug ) He was charged with possessing a controlled substance.','an organic substance (= from a living thing ) Despite being an organic substance, ivory is remarkably durable.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('e660da33-a20b-5e04-b3a0-11357ef77f25','99045a3f-694f-5ddf-a137-bf8a88a411e8',1,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who supports a particular person, group, or plan',null,null,'طرفدار، پشتیبان؛ هوادار (تیم)؛ حامی (کار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a strong supporter He was a strong supporter of co-education.','a loyal supporter The party still has many loyal supporters.','a staunch supporter (= a strong and loyal supporter ) Even his staunchest supporters acknowledge that he is unlikely to win.','an enthusiastic/keen supporter Eisenhower had been an enthusiastic supporter of the regime.','an ardent/fervent supporter (= very enthusiastic ) She is an ardent supporter of the government''s proposed tax reforms.','an active supporter He remained an active supporter of Greenpeace.','a leading supporter Many of his leading supporters had by now either escaped abroad or been captured.','a political supporter He is one of the governor''s key political supporters.','Obama/Labour etc supporters Most of the newspaper''s readers were Labour supporters.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"one of Bush’s staunchest supporters","translation":"یکی از سرسخت ترین حامیان بوش","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000600867.mp3"},{"sentence":"supporters of animal rights legislation","translation":"حامیان قانون حقوق حیوانات","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612444.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('d711a25f-c335-58dc-ac66-a0ee951302cc','99045a3f-694f-5ddf-a137-bf8a88a411e8',2,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who likes a particular sports team , and often goes to watch them play',null,null,'کسی که یک تیم ورزشی خاص را دوست دارد و اغلب به تماشای بازی آنها می رود',array['fan']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a strong supporter He was a strong supporter of co-education.','a loyal supporter The party still has many loyal supporters.','a staunch supporter (= a strong and loyal supporter ) Even his staunchest supporters acknowledge that he is unlikely to win.','an enthusiastic/keen supporter Eisenhower had been an enthusiastic supporter of the regime.','an ardent/fervent supporter (= very enthusiastic ) She is an ardent supporter of the government''s proposed tax reforms.','an active supporter He remained an active supporter of Greenpeace.','a leading supporter Many of his leading supporters had by now either escaped abroad or been captured.','a political supporter He is one of the governor''s key political supporters.','Obama/Labour etc supporters Most of the newspaper''s readers were Labour supporters.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Manchester United supporters","translation":"هواداران منچستریونایتد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000600879.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('7cff00a0-a45e-574f-a490-e6819348cce2','f59676da-c5a6-53a6-b1ac-bc8903a2f926',1,null,null,'spoken & written','having a feeling of surprise',null,null,'شگفت‌زده، متعجب','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['very/really surprised I would be very surprised if that was the case.','quite surprised I was quite surprised at his reaction.','a little/somewhat/slightly surprised He was a little surprised by her request.','mildly surprised (= slightly surprised ) He looked mildly surprised by the question.','pleasantly surprised (= when someone has a pleasant surprise ) You will probably be pleasantly surprised at the amount of food you are allowed to eat on this diet.','genuinely surprised ‘Me?’ Theodora seemed genuinely surprised.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He looked surprised to see Cassie standing by the front door.","translation":"با دیدن کیسی که کنار در ایستاده بود متعجب به نظر می رسید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602377.mp3"},{"sentence":"We were greatly surprised at the news.","translation":"ما از این خبر بسیار شگفت زده شدیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602380.mp3"},{"sentence":"She was surprised that no one was there to greet her.","translation":"او تعجب کرد که کسی برای احوالپرسی نبود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602383.mp3"},{"sentence":"I bet she’ll be really surprised to see me.","translation":"شرط می بندم که او واقعاً از دیدن من شگفت زده می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602386.mp3"},{"sentence":"He had a surprised look on his face.","translation":"چهره متعجبی داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602389.mp3"},{"sentence":"Don’t be surprised if the interviewer is rather direct.","translation":"اگر مصاحبه کننده نسبتاً مستقیم باشد تعجب نکنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602394.mp3"},{"sentence":"I wouldn’t be surprised if she married that fellow.","translation":"من تعجب نمی کنم اگر او با آن شخص ازدواج کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602399.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('6e1bd753-552e-52bf-83b6-02afa5ad9379','82be84c6-bb32-5cc7-80e2-c994079d9b6d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a feeling you have that someone is probably guilty of doing something wrong or dishonest','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'ظن، سوءظن؛ گمان (خطا)؛ مظنون (پلیس)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have your suspicions Many of us had our suspicions, but we couldn''t prove anything.','confirm somebody''s suspicions (= show that someone''s suspicions were right ) The letter confirmed my suspicions.','arouse suspicion (= make people think that someone has done something wrong ) How was he able to kill his victims without arousing suspicion?','raise suspicions (= make people think that someone has done something wrong ) That fact immediately raised suspicions of Johnson''s involvement in the incident.','be/come under suspicion (= be thought to have probably done something wrong ) He was still under suspicion of fraud.','allay suspicion formal (= make people stop having suspicions ) She had to allay their suspicions and stop them probing any further.','divert suspicion (= make people have suspicions about someone else ) He started the rumour to divert suspicion from himself.','suspicion falls on somebody Suspicion fell on Jenkins who had been seen near the scene of the crime.','grounds for suspicion (= reasons for suspicion ) Police can stop and search you if they have good grounds for suspicion.','be above/beyond suspicion (= be so honest that you are never thought to have done something wrong ) He regarded his friend Henry as being above suspicion.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I can’t say for definite who did it, but I certainly have my suspicions .","translation":"نمی توانم به طور قطعی بگویم چه کسی این کار را انجام داده است، اما مطمئناً شک دارم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577321.mp3"},{"sentence":"Police suspicions were confirmed when the stolen property was found in his flat.","translation":"با پیدا شدن اموال مسروقه در آپارتمان وی، شک پلیس تایید شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577327.mp3"},{"sentence":"I wondered how I could leave early without arousing anyone’s suspicions .","translation":"تعجب کردم که چگونه می توانم زودتر بروم بدون اینکه شک کسی را برانگیخته باشم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577333.mp3"},{"sentence":"She was arrested on suspicion of murder.","translation":"او به ظن قتل دستگیر شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000603159.mp3"},{"sentence":"He felt he was still under suspicion.","translation":"او احساس می کرد که هنوز در مظنون است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577343.mp3"},{"sentence":"Mitchell later came under suspicion of assaulting two young girls.","translation":"میچل بعداً مظنون به تعرض به دو دختر جوان شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577344.mp3"},{"sentence":"She felt that she ought to be above suspicion (= so honest that no one could think that she had done anything wrong ) .","translation":"او احساس می کرد که باید فراتر از سوءظن باشد (= آنقدر صادق که هیچ کس نمی تواند فکر کند که او کار اشتباهی انجام داده است).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000603171.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('6398411c-d462-5596-b105-0e7017cc8d50','82be84c6-bb32-5cc7-80e2-c994079d9b6d',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a feeling that you do not trust someone','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'احساس اینکه به کسی اعتماد ندارید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She always treated us with suspicion .","translation":"او همیشه با ما مشکوک رفتار می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000603176.mp3"},{"sentence":"People moving into the area are often regarded with suspicion .","translation":"افرادی که به این منطقه می روند اغلب با سوء ظن در نظر گرفته می شوند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577358.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('233116ed-8d67-5e1e-bb9c-e7b365c7b59f','82be84c6-bb32-5cc7-80e2-c994079d9b6d',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a feeling you have that something is true, especially something bad','[ countable ]',null,'احساس می کنید که چیزی درست است، به خصوص چیز بد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I have a suspicion that the local authority may be planning to close the school.","translation":"من شک دارم که مقامات محلی ممکن است قصد تعطیلی مدرسه را داشته باشند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577364.mp3"},{"sentence":"She was left with a sneaking suspicion (= a small suspicion ) that Steven was not telling the truth.","translation":"او با یک سوء ظن پنهانی (= یک سوء ظن کوچک) باقی ماند که استیون حقیقت را نمی گوید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577370.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('e710f62a-dc9e-5a53-ac12-6a481a375ca0','82be84c6-bb32-5cc7-80e2-c994079d9b6d',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'a suspicion of something','ظن، سوءظن؛ گمان (خطا)؛ مظنون (پلیس)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('bfc1d6d1-62b2-5304-a559-3e9402a22d2a','2f4cfab0-2169-53dd-967d-3fb03de50a65',1,'machines','ماشین آلات','spoken & written','connected with knowledge of how machines work',null,null,'فنی، تکنیکی (فرد)؛ فنی (توضیح)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Our staff will be available to give you technical support .","translation":"کارکنان ما برای ارائه پشتیبانی فنی به شما در دسترس خواهند بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001727706.mp3"},{"sentence":"I have no technical knowledge at all.","translation":"من اصلا دانش فنی ندارم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000585026.mp3"},{"sentence":"technical training","translation":"آموزش فنی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000585027.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('32320a26-1d5c-5b75-aac5-aed0d13b20e3','2f4cfab0-2169-53dd-967d-3fb03de50a65',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'technical problem/hitch','فنی، تکنیکی (فرد)؛ فنی (توضیح)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('60d5fed2-1ec8-5b03-8558-4ef9c2292e0b','2f4cfab0-2169-53dd-967d-3fb03de50a65',3,'language','زبان','spoken & written','technical language is language that is difficult for most people to understand because it is connected with one particular subject or used in one particular job',null,null,'زبان فنی زبانی است که درک آن برای اکثر مردم دشوار است زیرا با یک موضوع خاص مرتبط است یا در یک شغل خاص استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I didn’t understand all the technical terms .","translation":"من همه اصطلاحات فنی را متوجه نشدم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000585037.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('53b76b73-7aa3-5c20-b2d1-d8c3a7212a04','2f4cfab0-2169-53dd-967d-3fb03de50a65',4,'details/rules','جزئیات/قوانین','spoken & written','relating to small exact details or rules that say how a system should work',null,null,'مربوط به جزئیات دقیق کوچک یا قوانینی است که می گوید یک سیستم چگونه باید کار کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He called for the legislation to be delayed on a technical point.","translation":"وی خواستار به تعویق افتادن قانون در مورد یک نکته فنی شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001727711.mp3"},{"sentence":"This is a technical violation of the treaty.","translation":"این یک نقض فنی معاهده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001727712.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('5ee45bb9-a6a0-5e7a-ac47-42e78fae540b','2f4cfab0-2169-53dd-967d-3fb03de50a65',5,'skills','مهارت ها','spoken & written','technical ability is the ability to do the difficult things that you have to do in order to play music , do a sport etc',null,null,'توانایی فنی توانایی انجام کارهای دشواری است که برای نواختن موسیقی، انجام یک ورزش و غیره باید انجام دهید.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a young player with a lot of technical ability","translation":"یک بازیکن جوان با توانایی های فنی بالا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000585051.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('f4211c15-7728-54a6-8a45-a7aec393115d','b5355177-3d65-5ad3-8675-ebff3cbcc4b9',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a special way of doing something','[ countable ]',null,'فن، تکنیک؛ شیوه (کار)؛ تکنیک (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['use a technique ( also employ a technique formal ) By using commercial shipbuilding techniques, the Navy hoped to reduce costs.','devise/develop a technique Researchers hope to develop more accurate testing techniques.','learn a technique We will help the beginner learn these basic techniques.','practise a technique Practise your painting techniques on unwanted pieces of wallpaper.','basic techniques The girls are taught the basic techniques of childcare.','modern techniques Archaeologists now use modern techniques such as aerial photography.','a simple technique It is amazing what a difference these simple techniques can make.','an effective technique This is an effective technique for removing unwanted hair.','a standard technique A sample of blood was obtained from each patient using the standard technique.','management techniques He praised their management techniques.','relaxation techniques Patients are taught relaxation techniques to use at home.','surgical techniques Surgical techniques have improved considerably in the last twenty years.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There are various techniques for dealing with industrial pollution.","translation":"تکنیک های مختلفی برای مقابله با آلودگی های صنعتی وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000585166.mp3"},{"sentence":"In mathematics, we use many techniques of problem-solving.","translation":"در ریاضیات، ما از تکنیک های زیادی برای حل مسئله استفاده می کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001727740.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('12e3a50e-ed92-5245-81cb-248f69f422ca','b5355177-3d65-5ad3-8675-ebff3cbcc4b9',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the special way in which you move your body when you are playing music , doing a sport etc, which is difficult to learn and needs a lot of skill','[ uncountable ]',null,'روش خاصی که در هنگام پخش موسیقی، انجام ورزش و غیره بدن خود را حرکت می دهید، که یادگیری آن دشوار است و به مهارت زیادی نیاز دارد.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['use a technique ( also employ a technique formal ) By using commercial shipbuilding techniques, the Navy hoped to reduce costs.','devise/develop a technique Researchers hope to develop more accurate testing techniques.','learn a technique We will help the beginner learn these basic techniques.','practise a technique Practise your painting techniques on unwanted pieces of wallpaper.','basic techniques The girls are taught the basic techniques of childcare.','modern techniques Archaeologists now use modern techniques such as aerial photography.','a simple technique It is amazing what a difference these simple techniques can make.','an effective technique This is an effective technique for removing unwanted hair.','a standard technique A sample of blood was obtained from each patient using the standard technique.','management techniques He praised their management techniques.','relaxation techniques Patients are taught relaxation techniques to use at home.','surgical techniques Surgical techniques have improved considerably in the last twenty years.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He’s a great player, with brilliant technique.","translation":"او بازیکن بزرگی است، با تکنیک درخشان.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001727745.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('fdd9a884-9dd3-5eac-b9f1-8d1c02631bee','940ced0e-b344-58e7-9b8e-d4cd892ec21f',1,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the telephone','تلفن، دستگاه تلفن؛ تلفن (همراه)؛ تلفن (عمومی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a telephone rings The telephone rang, but Tom didn’t answer it.','answer the telephone When I called the house, Mike answered the telephone.','talk on the telephone He was talking on the telephone when the doorbell rang.','use the telephone May I use your telephone?','pick up the telephone As soon as she got home, she picked up the telephone and dialled his number.','put down the telephone Before he could respond, she’d put down the telephone.','call somebody on the telephone Her son doesn’t even call her on the telephone.','a telephone call She got a telephone call from Joe last night.','a telephone conversation We had a long telephone conversation.','a telephone line They didn’t even have a telephone line.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('7b8c16e3-663b-5141-b9a9-882938160811','940ced0e-b344-58e7-9b8e-d4cd892ec21f',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the piece of equipment that you use when you are talking to someone by telephone','[ countable ]',null,'قطعه ای از تجهیزاتی که هنگام صحبت با کسی از طریق تلفن استفاده می کنید',array['phone']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a telephone rings The telephone rang, but Tom didn’t answer it.','answer the telephone When I called the house, Mike answered the telephone.','talk on the telephone He was talking on the telephone when the doorbell rang.','use the telephone May I use your telephone?','pick up the telephone As soon as she got home, she picked up the telephone and dialled his number.','put down the telephone Before he could respond, she’d put down the telephone.','call somebody on the telephone Her son doesn’t even call her on the telephone.','a telephone call She got a telephone call from Joe last night.','a telephone conversation We had a long telephone conversation.','a telephone line They didn’t even have a telephone line.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The telephone rang just as I was leaving.","translation":"درست موقع رفتنم تلفن زنگ خورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001727828.mp3"},{"sentence":"She picked up the telephone and dialled a number.","translation":"تلفن را برداشت و شماره ای گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001727832.mp3"},{"sentence":"I said goodbye and put down the telephone .","translation":"خداحافظی کردم و گوشی رو گذاشتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001727836.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('229b7b12-73ed-5942-867c-443a61bbb0c9','940ced0e-b344-58e7-9b8e-d4cd892ec21f',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'be on the telephone','تلفن، دستگاه تلفن؛ تلفن (همراه)؛ تلفن (عمومی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('6172a841-25a8-565e-8561-055e8ae37abf','303d7dc2-99df-56a0-bbfa-e586da8ceb8c',1,null,null,'formal','to talk to someone by telephone',null,null,'با کسی تلفنی صحبت کردن',array['phone','call']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Sammy telephoned to say that he would be late.","translation":"سامی تلفن زد و گفت که دیر خواهد آمد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000586316.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ll telephone you later.","translation":"بعدا بهت زنگ میزنم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001727841.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
