('ee5403d5-fb28-53db-8794-35039bb6da25','721c9e3e-5162-5d90-bc25-7f7eea934f8f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to expect that something will happen and be ready for it',null,null,'پیش‌بینی کردن و آماده بودن برای آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Sales are better than anticipated.","translation":"فروش بهتر از حد انتظار است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001656992.mp3"},{"sentence":"The schedule isn’t final, but we don’t anticipate many changes.","translation":"برنامه نهایی نیست، اما ما تغییرات زیادی را پیش بینی نمی کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001656995.mp3"},{"sentence":"We don’t anticipate any problems.","translation":"ما هیچ مشکلی را پیش بینی نمی کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001656998.mp3"},{"sentence":"A good speaker is able to anticipate an audience’s needs and concerns.","translation":"یک سخنران خوب می تواند نیازها و نگرانی های مخاطب را پیش بینی کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001656999.mp3"},{"sentence":"This year, we anticipate that our expenses will be 15% greater.","translation":"امسال پیش بینی می کنیم که هزینه های ما 15 درصد بیشتر شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000982483.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is anticipated that the research will have many different practical applications.","translation":"پیش بینی می شود که این تحقیق کاربردهای عملی بسیار متفاوتی داشته باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001657002.mp3"},{"sentence":"I didn’t anticipate having to do the cooking myself!","translation":"من پیش بینی نمی کردم که آشپزی را خودم انجام دهم!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000982486.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('89d04aca-cf62-5589-8a61-10b6b7c8e16a','721c9e3e-5162-5d90-bc25-7f7eea934f8f',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to think about something that is going to happen, especially something pleasant',null,null,'فکر کردن در مورد چیزی که قرار است اتفاق بیفتد، به خصوص چیزی خوشایند',array['look forward to']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Daniel was eagerly anticipating her arrival.","translation":"دنیل مشتاقانه منتظر آمدن او بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000982490.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('fbbfd351-b73d-58af-af85-3b9043bf46e1','721c9e3e-5162-5d90-bc25-7f7eea934f8f',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to do something before someone else',null,null,'انجام کاری قبل از دیگری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Copernicus anticipated in part the discoveries of the 17th and 18th centuries.","translation":"کوپرنیک تا حدی اکتشافات قرن 17 و 18 را پیش بینی کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000982494.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c1350286-e528-57a3-975f-997da4e22e5e','76be7d34-5ff7-5386-8c8b-ee373027412c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to say that you have heard that something is true, although you are not completely sure about it','[ sentence adverb ]',null,'ظاهراً، به‌ظاهر؛ طبق شنیده‌ها','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Apparently the company is losing a lot of money.","translation":"ظاهراً شرکت در حال از دست دادن پول زیادی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000943602.mp3"},{"sentence":"I wasn’t there, but apparently it went well.","translation":"من آنجا نبودم، اما ظاهراً خوب پیش رفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000943603.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('7f8a315b-b300-5a32-aec9-4fac67575748','76be7d34-5ff7-5386-8c8b-ee373027412c',2,null,null,'spoken & written','according to the way someone looks or a situation appears, although you cannot be sure',null,null,'با توجه به شکل ظاهری شخصی یا ظاهر شدن یک موقعیت، اگرچه نمی توانید مطمئن باشید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She turned to face him, her anger apparently gone.","translation":"به طرف او برگشت، ظاهراً عصبانیتش از بین رفته بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001647403.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('87bffa27-3cc5-5a6b-a0db-40ab30dcb1bc','d07d0a09-ffd2-5c6b-9df9-9a535f7810cc',1,'way somebody/something looks','طرز نگاه کسی/چیزی','spoken & written','the way someone or something looks to other people','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'ظاهر، شکل و شمایل؛ آمدن به انظار','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['somebody''s/something''s physical appearance If you want to improve your physical appearance, eat well and exercise.','somebody''s personal appearance Teenagers are very conscious of their personal appearance.','somebody''s/something''s odd/strange appearance Children sometimes stared at him because of his odd appearance.','a distinctive/striking appearance (= unusual and interesting ) The unusual leaves give the plant a distinctive appearance.','an attractive/handsome/pleasing etc appearance Large blue eyes set in a long thin face give him a striking and attractive appearance.','somebody''s youthful appearance She was no longer a young woman, despite her youthful appearance.','the outward appearance Beneath the outward appearance of confidence, she is very shy.','the general/overall appearance The second phase of the project is to improve the town’s overall appearance.','the visual appearance Intensive farming changed the visual appearance of the countryside.','have a ... appearance The young girl had a pleasing appearance.','improve/enhance the appearance of something/somebody Fresh air improves the appearance of the skin.','change/alter the appearance of something The proposed dam will change the appearance of the surrounding countryside enormously.','give something/somebody a … appearance His uniform gave him an official appearance.','take pride in your appearance (= make an effort to look good ) She seems to take no pride at all in her personal appearance these days.','judge by appearances (= make judgements based on the way someone or something looks ) You shouldn’t judge by appearances.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He was always criticising his wife’s appearance.","translation":"او همیشه از ظاهر همسرش انتقاد می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000984281.mp3"},{"sentence":"They’ve changed the appearance of the whole building.","translation":"آنها ظاهر کل ساختمان را تغییر داده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001913260.mp3"},{"sentence":"We are often attracted to somebody first by their physical appearance .","translation":"ما اغلب به واسطه ظاهر جسمانی کسی جذب می شویم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001672299.mp3"},{"sentence":"Women, in general, tend to be more concerned than men about their personal appearance .","translation":"زنان، به طور کلی، بیشتر از مردان در مورد ظاهر شخصی خود نگران هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001941387.mp3"},{"sentence":"She had an outward appearance of calm, but deep down she was really worried.","translation":"او ظاهری آرام داشت، اما در اعماق وجودش واقعاً نگران بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001913265.mp3"},{"sentence":"The metal posts spoiled the appearance of the garden.","translation":"ستون های فلزی ظاهر باغ را خراب کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001913269.mp3"},{"sentence":"A garnish helps to enhance the appearance of any dish.","translation":"چاشنی به زیبایی ظاهر هر ظرفی کمک می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001913261.mp3"},{"sentence":"She’s the kind of woman who takes pride in her appearance .","translation":"او از آن دسته زنی است که به ظاهر خود افتخار می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001913273.mp3"},{"sentence":"You shouldn’t judge by appearances .","translation":"نباید از روی ظاهر قضاوت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001913276.mp3"},{"sentence":"They work hard at school without giving the appearance of being particularly hard-working.","translation":"آن‌ها در مدرسه سخت کار می‌کنند، بدون اینکه ظاهراً سخت کوش باشند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001913280.mp3"},{"sentence":"The case had all the appearances of a straightforward murder.","translation":"این پرونده تمام ظواهر یک قتل مستقیم را داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001913284.mp3"},{"sentence":"The pupils looked angelic – but appearances can be deceptive .","translation":"مردمک ها فرشته ای به نظر می رسیدند - اما ظاهر می تواند فریبنده باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001913288.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was, to all appearances , a respectable, successful businessman.","translation":"او از نظر ظاهری یک تاجر محترم و موفق بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000984294.mp3"}]'::jsonb,13),
('1008f81c-2cf9-5e84-b70a-16a34c337063','d07d0a09-ffd2-5c6b-9df9-9a535f7810cc',2,'somebody takes part in a public event','کسی در یک رویداد عمومی شرکت می کند','spoken & written','when a famous person takes part in a film, concert , or other public event','[ countable ]',null,'زمانی که یک شخص مشهور در یک فیلم، کنسرت یا سایر رویدادهای عمومی شرکت می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It was his first public appearance since the election.","translation":"این اولین حضور عمومی او پس از انتخابات بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000984330.mp3"},{"sentence":"He made his last appearance for the club in the Cup Final.","translation":"او آخرین حضور خود را برای این باشگاه در فینال جام حذفی انجام داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001672316.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
