('6724a40a-f198-565b-ad88-d759c9924420','ef7892e2-7b81-5739-9d1d-3d058c162745',1,null,null,'spoken & written','related to business and the buying and selling of goods and services',null,null,'تجاری؛ تجارت‌محور؛ سودآور','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a commercial bank (= one that accepts people’s money, provides loans etc ) Several large commercial banks cut their lending rates.','a commercial company/organization Many commercial companies are having financial difficulties.','commercial property (= property for businesses and industry ) He decided to invest in commercial property.','commercial interests (= things that bring business advantages ) The president’s reform programme threatened US commercial interests.','the commercial sector (= the business part of the economy ) The commercial sector sponsors sport.','the commercial market (= the market for goods ) A product like this should do well in the commercial market.','commercial development (= the building of houses, hotels, restaurants etc ) The increased number of tourists has resulted in further commercial development.','commercial use The trees were planted for commercial use.','commercial exploitation (= using something, especially natural resources, to make money ) the commercial exploitation of mineral resources','commercial activity Commercial activity in our society is highly competitive.','commercial considerations/reasons/purposes Commercial considerations must come second to conservation of the environment.','a commercial transaction (= a business deal ) The deal was a straightforward commercial transaction.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Our top priorities must be profit and commercial growth.","translation":"اولویت اصلی ما باید سود و رشد تجاری باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000873822.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
