('19127e4e-b89d-51c5-b4ba-39d97ee51b45','c536c9f8-f03f-597a-8b15-87ff2621fc1c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a group of people who have been given the official job of finding out about something or controlling something','[ countable ]',null,'کمیسیون، هیئت رسمی؛ کمیسیون (پورسانت)؛ ارتکاب','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['set up/establish/create a commission They set up a commission to investigate the problem of youth crime.','appoint a commission (= choose the members of a commission ) The president appointed a commission to develop standards in schools.','head a commission (= be in charge of one ) He was elected to head a commission on tax reform.','a commission recommends something The commission recommended that the federal government change the way it measures inflation.','a commission approves something The commission approved the plan.','a special commission A special commission was set up to investigate the killings.','an independent commission The plan requires approval by an independent commission.','an international commission an international commission on climate change','a parliamentary commission A report was made by a special parliamentary commission.','a government commission A government commission regulates the process.','a national/federal commission the National Commission on Terrorism','a presidential commission the Presidential Commission on Health Care','a joint commission (= involving two or more countries or groups ) a new India-Sri Lanka joint commission','an investigative/investigating commission An investigative commission was set up immediately after the incident.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The Government set up a commission to investigate allegations of police violence.","translation":"دولت کمیسیونی را برای بررسی اتهامات خشونت پلیس راه اندازی کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001669010.mp3"},{"sentence":"the Royal Commission on Environmental Pollution","translation":"کمیسیون سلطنتی آلودگی محیط زیست","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001669018.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('a62fecd1-c2af-5067-b06b-56a53ee99a1c','c536c9f8-f03f-597a-8b15-87ff2621fc1c',2,null,null,'spoken & written','an extra amount of money that is paid to a person or organization according to the value of the goods they have sold or the services they have provided','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'مبلغ اضافی پولی که با توجه به ارزش کالایی که فروخته یا خدماتی که ارائه کرده است به شخص یا سازمان پرداخت می شود.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['set up/establish/create a commission They set up a commission to investigate the problem of youth crime.','appoint a commission (= choose the members of a commission ) The president appointed a commission to develop standards in schools.','head a commission (= be in charge of one ) He was elected to head a commission on tax reform.','a commission recommends something The commission recommended that the federal government change the way it measures inflation.','a commission approves something The commission approved the plan.','a special commission A special commission was set up to investigate the killings.','an independent commission The plan requires approval by an independent commission.','an international commission an international commission on climate change','a parliamentary commission A report was made by a special parliamentary commission.','a government commission A government commission regulates the process.','a national/federal commission the National Commission on Terrorism','a presidential commission the Presidential Commission on Health Care','a joint commission (= involving two or more countries or groups ) a new India-Sri Lanka joint commission','an investigative/investigating commission An investigative commission was set up immediately after the incident.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The dealer takes a 20% commission on the sales he makes.","translation":"فروشنده از فروش هایی که انجام می دهد 20٪ کمیسیون می گیرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001095120.mp3"},{"sentence":"He sold cosmetics on commission.","translation":"او لوازم آرایشی را به صورت سفارشی می فروخت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001669019.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('2dfc257f-0366-50fb-b198-bb8c3c7bc5e9','c536c9f8-f03f-597a-8b15-87ff2621fc1c',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a request for an artist , designer , or musician to make a piece of art or music , for which they are paid','[ countable ]',null,'درخواست از یک هنرمند، طراح یا نوازنده برای ساخت یک قطعه هنری یا موسیقی که به آنها پول پرداخت می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['set up/establish/create a commission They set up a commission to investigate the problem of youth crime.','appoint a commission (= choose the members of a commission ) The president appointed a commission to develop standards in schools.','head a commission (= be in charge of one ) He was elected to head a commission on tax reform.','a commission recommends something The commission recommended that the federal government change the way it measures inflation.','a commission approves something The commission approved the plan.','a special commission A special commission was set up to investigate the killings.','an independent commission The plan requires approval by an independent commission.','an international commission an international commission on climate change','a parliamentary commission A report was made by a special parliamentary commission.','a government commission A government commission regulates the process.','a national/federal commission the National Commission on Terrorism','a presidential commission the Presidential Commission on Health Care','a joint commission (= involving two or more countries or groups ) a new India-Sri Lanka joint commission','an investigative/investigating commission An investigative commission was set up immediately after the incident.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a commission from the Academy for a new sculpture","translation":"سفارشی از آکادمی برای یک مجسمه جدید","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001095131.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
