('72d6eff5-f53e-5c14-998e-bbb54a2f7923','cb864c1f-284b-59f3-a0b0-0bf04cc08f03',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a promise to do something or to behave in a particular way','[ countable ]',null,'تعهد، پابندی؛ سپردن (وقت، انرژی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a commitment Getting married involves making a serious commitment.','give a commitment The government gave a commitment to withdraw all its forces.','something requires/demands (a) commitment Nursing as a profession demands genuine commitment.','honour/meet a commitment (= do what you promised to do ) Will they honour their commitment to a ceasefire?','show/demonstrate commitment Throughout her life she demonstrated her deep commitment to the needs of the poor.','lack commitment I never get promoted because they think I lack commitment.','reaffirm/restate/reiterate a commitment (= give a promise again ) They reaffirmed their commitment to abandon nuclear power.','real/genuine commitment The job demands real commitment to teaching.','personal commitment As a company, we expect a personal commitment from our staff to do their best.','strong commitment She''s known for her strong commitment to women''s rights.','long-term commitment Having a child together involves a long-term commitment.','a lifelong commitment Marriage is a lifelong commitment.','full/total commitment Such therapies demand full commitment from the patient.','political commitment There was no local political commitment to the proposal.','religious commitment Many people have ceased to have any active religious commitment.','a lack of commitment His lack of commitment to the project was easy to see.','a level of commitment This post demands a high level of commitment.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Are you ready to make a long-term commitment ?","translation":"آیا برای تعهد بلند مدت آماده اید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001669090.mp3"},{"sentence":"Our company has a commitment to quality and customer service.","translation":"شرکت ما متعهد به کیفیت و خدمات مشتری است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001095835.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('217838fa-842e-5d88-9a73-b792c3d9c7ae','cb864c1f-284b-59f3-a0b0-0bf04cc08f03',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the hard work and loyalty that someone gives to an organization , activity etc','[ uncountable ]',null,'سخت کوشی و وفاداری که کسی به یک سازمان، فعالیت و غیره می دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a commitment Getting married involves making a serious commitment.','give a commitment The government gave a commitment to withdraw all its forces.','something requires/demands (a) commitment Nursing as a profession demands genuine commitment.','honour/meet a commitment (= do what you promised to do ) Will they honour their commitment to a ceasefire?','show/demonstrate commitment Throughout her life she demonstrated her deep commitment to the needs of the poor.','lack commitment I never get promoted because they think I lack commitment.','reaffirm/restate/reiterate a commitment (= give a promise again ) They reaffirmed their commitment to abandon nuclear power.','real/genuine commitment The job demands real commitment to teaching.','personal commitment As a company, we expect a personal commitment from our staff to do their best.','strong commitment She''s known for her strong commitment to women''s rights.','long-term commitment Having a child together involves a long-term commitment.','a lifelong commitment Marriage is a lifelong commitment.','full/total commitment Such therapies demand full commitment from the patient.','political commitment There was no local political commitment to the proposal.','religious commitment Many people have ceased to have any active religious commitment.','a lack of commitment His lack of commitment to the project was easy to see.','a level of commitment This post demands a high level of commitment.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I was impressed by the energy and commitment shown by the players.","translation":"من تحت تاثیر انرژی و تعهد بازیکنان قرار گرفتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001095840.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her commitment to work is beyond question.","translation":"تعهد او به کار فراتر از سؤال است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001095843.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('69c9c064-f894-56e5-a1c7-1d3fad2b4d82','cb864c1f-284b-59f3-a0b0-0bf04cc08f03',3,null,null,'spoken & written','something that you have promised you will do or that you have to do','[ countable ]',null,'کاری که قول داده اید انجام می دهید یا باید انجام دهید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Will the job fit in with your family commitments ?","translation":"آیا شغل با تعهدات خانوادگی شما مطابقت دارد؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001095848.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('1619b36a-ba56-5026-bbae-6c78dd6a752e','cb864c1f-284b-59f3-a0b0-0bf04cc08f03',4,null,null,'spoken & written','an amount of money that you have to pay regularly','[ countable ]',null,'مقدار پولی که باید به طور منظم پرداخت کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I had a lot of financial commitments.","translation":"تعهدات مالی زیادی داشتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001095853.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('aa8b6282-25aa-581a-bcc5-d44ef57477e3','cb864c1f-284b-59f3-a0b0-0bf04cc08f03',5,null,null,'spoken & written','the use of money, time, people etc for a particular purpose','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'استفاده از پول، زمان، افراد و غیره برای یک هدف خاص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"commitments of food and medical aid of over $4 billion","translation":"تعهدات غذایی و کمک های پزشکی بیش از 4 میلیارد دلار","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001095860.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('de487356-95b7-504f-99c4-ff40edf54a8b','201450fa-5548-5ccd-afcf-882362caaa34',1,'comparing','مقایسه کردن','spoken & written','the process of comparing two or more people or things','[ uncountable ]',null,'مقایسه، سنجش؛ تشبیه؛ (صفت) نسبتاً','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Comparison with his previous movies shows how Lee has developed as a director.","translation":"مقایسه با فیلم های قبلی او نشان می دهد که لی چگونه به عنوان کارگردان پیشرفت کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001098173.mp3"},{"sentence":"In comparison to other recent video games, this one isn’t very exciting.","translation":"در مقایسه با سایر بازی های ویدیویی اخیر، این یکی خیلی هیجان انگیز نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001691332.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was a loud friendly man. In comparison, his brother was rather shy.","translation":"او مرد خوش صدایی بود. در مقایسه، برادرش نسبتاً خجالتی بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001691333.mp3"},{"sentence":"By comparison with other European countries, car prices in the UK are very high.","translation":"در مقایسه با سایر کشورهای اروپایی، قیمت خودرو در بریتانیا بسیار بالا است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001691336.mp3"},{"sentence":"After months of living in a tropical climate, Spain seemed cool by comparison.","translation":"پس از ماه ها زندگی در یک آب و هوای گرمسیری، اسپانیا در مقایسه با آن سرد به نظر می رسید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001691337.mp3"},{"sentence":"These figures are provided for comparison with the results of previous studies.","translation":"این ارقام برای مقایسه با نتایج مطالعات قبلی ارائه شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001691340.mp3"},{"sentence":"He showed us the original text for comparison.","translation":"او متن اصلی را برای مقایسه به ما نشان داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001691341.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her paintings invite comparison with those of the early Impressionists (= they remind you of them ) .","translation":"نقاشی های او نیاز به مقایسه با امپرسیونیست های اولیه دارد (= آنها را به شما یادآوری می کنند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001098189.mp3"},{"sentence":"Irving’s work bears comparison with the best of the modern novelists.","translation":"آثار ایروینگ با بهترین رمان نویسان مدرن مقایسه می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001098197.mp3"},{"sentence":"On comparison, the Renault was the more reliable of the two cars.","translation":"در مقایسه، رنو قابل اعتمادتر از این دو خودرو بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001098193.mp3"}]'::jsonb,10),
('3da6131c-5b41-58dc-b77a-c23e76ea36a9','201450fa-5548-5ccd-afcf-882362caaa34',2,'judgment','قضاوت','spoken & written','a statement or examination of how similar or different two people or things are','[ countable ]',null,'بیانیه یا بررسی اینکه دو فرد یا چیز چقدر شبیه یا متفاوت هستند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a comparison (= compare people or things ) Using the Internet is an easy way to make comparisons between prices.','draw a comparison (= say in what way people or things are similar ) People have drawn comparisons between this movie and those of Quentin Tarantino.','provide a comparison The test can be used to provide a comparison of a child''s language development with that of other children.','a direct comparison You can’t really make a direct comparison between the the two schools.','an interesting comparison The exhibition provides an interesting comparison of the artists’ works.','a valid/useful/meaningful comparison (= a reasonable one, based on sensible information ) There is not enough data for a valid comparison to be made.','a fair/unfair comparison A fair comparison between the two firms is extremely difficult.','a favourable/unfavourable comparison (= in which one thing or person is judged to be better/worse than another ) My family was always making unfavourable comparisons between me and my older brother.','a detailed comparison Students had to write a detailed comparison of the two texts.','a price comparison A price comparison shopping site was launched last month.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a comparison of pollution levels in Chicago and Detroit","translation":"مقایسه سطوح آلودگی در شیکاگو و دیترویت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001098206.mp3"},{"sentence":"The article makes a comparison between the two poems.","translation":"مقاله مقایسه ای بین این دو شعر انجام می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001098209.mp3"},{"sentence":"The writer draws a comparison between the 1950s and the present day.","translation":"نویسنده مقایسه ای بین دهه 1950 و امروز انجام می دهد.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,3),
('e4352de5-51a6-5f09-bf11-47fc9da95bb2','201450fa-5548-5ccd-afcf-882362caaa34',3,'be like something','شبیه چیزی باشد','spoken & written','a statement that someone or something is like someone or something else','[ countable ]',null,'بیانی که نشان می دهد کسی یا چیزی شبیه کسی یا چیز دیگری است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The writer draws comparisons between the two presidents.","translation":"نویسنده به مقایسه بین دو رئیس جمهور پرداخته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001098226.mp3"},{"sentence":"You can’t make a comparison between American and Japanese schools – they’re too different.","translation":"شما نمی توانید بین مدارس آمریکایی و ژاپنی مقایسه کنید - آنها بسیار متفاوت هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001098222.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('e5264875-4d70-5552-af49-8952cbe5b9a9','201450fa-5548-5ccd-afcf-882362caaa34',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'there’s no comparison','مقایسه، سنجش؛ تشبیه؛ (صفت) نسبتاً','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('3c2a4952-bf1f-5e4a-83bb-c411f4da8444','201450fa-5548-5ccd-afcf-882362caaa34',5,'grammar','دستور زبان','spoken & written','a word used in grammar meaning the way an adverb or adjective changes its form to show whether it is comparative or superlative','[ uncountable ]',null,'کلمه ای که در دستور زبان استفاده می شود به معنای نحوه تغییر شکل یک قید یا صفت برای نشان دادن مقایسه ای یا عالی بودن آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('678a4c1b-90a6-5d5f-8bfa-0966746b1131','dbe7d1d7-c387-5a46-b501-1ffeee392e51',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to the greatest degree possible',null,null,'کاملاً، تماماً؛ به‌طور بی‌قیدوشرط',array['totally']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I completely forgot that it’s his birthday today.","translation":"من کاملاً فراموش کردم که امروز تولد اوست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000876176.mp3"},{"sentence":"He had never completely recovered from his illness.","translation":"او هرگز به طور کامل از بیماری خود بهبود نیافته بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001696996.mp3"},{"sentence":"a completely new range of low-cost computers","translation":"طیف کاملاً جدیدی از رایانه های ارزان قیمت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000876179.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m not completely sure.","translation":"من کاملا مطمئن نیستم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001696997.mp3"},{"sentence":"Portuguese is pronounced completely differently from Spanish.","translation":"پرتغالی کاملا متفاوت از اسپانیایی تلفظ می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000876180.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('71ff546d-3d26-5156-b46d-ffe551edb336','5119a3cc-866d-55ca-90fb-5d85615307fc',1,null,null,'spoken & written','about or relating to',null,null,'درباره، پیرامونِ، راجع به','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"calls from young children concerning lost pets","translation":"تماس های کودکان خردسال در مورد حیوانات خانگی گم شده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687819.mp3"},{"sentence":"the facts concerning Marr’s car crash","translation":"حقایق مربوط به تصادف اتومبیل مار","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687820.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ve already written to him about the problem.","translation":"من قبلاً در مورد مشکل برای او نامه نوشتم.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,3),
('40e33c62-cc8e-50a7-95ca-ede1d7243fd4','38e73de3-906b-5daa-9d4d-98fa642b3f0e',1,null,null,'spoken & written','something you decide after considering all the information you have','[ countable ]',null,'نتیجه‌گیری؛ پایان (نوشته)؛ عقد قرارداد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['come to/arrive at/reach a conclusion (= decide something ) I eventually came to the conclusion that I wanted to study law.','draw a conclusion (= decide something from what you learn or see ) We tried not to draw any conclusions too early in the investigation.','jump to/leap to conclusions (= decide something is true without knowing all the facts, especially when you are wrong ) Everyone jumped to the conclusion that we would get married.','lead to/point to a conclusion (= make you decide that something is true ) All the data led to only one conclusion.','support a conclusion (= suggest that something is true ) The evidence supports the conclusion that his death was an accident.','an obvious conclusion All her symptoms led to the obvious conclusion – she was pregnant.','the wrong conclusion Reporters saw the couple together and leapt to the wrong conclusion.','the right/correct conclusion I am sure that you came to the right conclusion.','the opposite conclusion A lot of scientific evidence supports the opposite conclusion.','the inescapable/inevitable conclusion (= one that is very obvious, although you may not like it ) The inescapable conclusion was that the country needed a change of leadership.','the logical conclusion (= one that makes sense when you think about it carefully ) The logical conclusion is that short commercials are just as effective as longer ones.','a firm conclusion (= definite decision ) At the end of the day, no firm conclusion had been reached.','a surprising/startling conclusion After years of research, he reached a startling conclusion.','a hasty conclusion (= one that you reach too quickly, so that you are probably wrong ) Researchers must beware of drawing hasty conclusions.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"These are the report’s main conclusions.","translation":"اینها نتایج اصلی گزارش است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000852303.mp3"},{"sentence":"I soon came to the conclusion that she was lying.","translation":"خیلی زود به این نتیجه رسیدم که او دروغ می گوید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716715.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is still too early to reach a conclusion on this point.","translation":"هنوز برای نتیجه گیری در این مورد خیلی زود است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716719.mp3"},{"sentence":"There are perhaps two main conclusions to be drawn from the above discussion.","translation":"شاید بتوان از بحث فوق دو نتیجه اصلی گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716725.mp3"},{"sentence":"All the evidence pointed to the conclusion that he was guilty.","translation":"تمام شواهد به این نتیجه رسید که او مجرم است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001939751.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s important not to jump to conclusions .","translation":"مهم است که عجولانه نتیجه نگیرید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000852316.mp3"},{"sentence":"The police came to the inescapable conclusion that the children had been murdered.","translation":"پلیس به این نتیجه اجتناب ناپذیر رسید که بچه ها به قتل رسیده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001844942.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('855f6f0d-ed57-5863-a02d-528f693dd4ee','38e73de3-906b-5daa-9d4d-98fa642b3f0e',2,null,null,'formal','the end or final part of something','[ countable ]',null,'پایان یا قسمت پایانی چیزی',array['end']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['come to/arrive at/reach a conclusion (= decide something ) I eventually came to the conclusion that I wanted to study law.','draw a conclusion (= decide something from what you learn or see ) We tried not to draw any conclusions too early in the investigation.','jump to/leap to conclusions (= decide something is true without knowing all the facts, especially when you are wrong ) Everyone jumped to the conclusion that we would get married.','lead to/point to a conclusion (= make you decide that something is true ) All the data led to only one conclusion.','support a conclusion (= suggest that something is true ) The evidence supports the conclusion that his death was an accident.','an obvious conclusion All her symptoms led to the obvious conclusion – she was pregnant.','the wrong conclusion Reporters saw the couple together and leapt to the wrong conclusion.','the right/correct conclusion I am sure that you came to the right conclusion.','the opposite conclusion A lot of scientific evidence supports the opposite conclusion.','the inescapable/inevitable conclusion (= one that is very obvious, although you may not like it ) The inescapable conclusion was that the country needed a change of leadership.','the logical conclusion (= one that makes sense when you think about it carefully ) The logical conclusion is that short commercials are just as effective as longer ones.','a firm conclusion (= definite decision ) At the end of the day, no firm conclusion had been reached.','a surprising/startling conclusion After years of research, he reached a startling conclusion.','a hasty conclusion (= one that you reach too quickly, so that you are probably wrong ) Researchers must beware of drawing hasty conclusions.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"At the conclusion of the meeting, little progress had been made.","translation":"در پایان جلسه، پیشرفت کمی حاصل شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716739.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
