emed to be only a loose connection between the questions and the answers.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"If this train gets delayed we’ll miss our connection to Paris.","translation":"اگر این قطار تاخیر داشته باشد، اتصال خود به پاریس را از دست خواهیم داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001103688.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
